# 原始 Schema

## 原始 Input Schema

<details>
<summary>展开查看完整 Input Schema</summary>

```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "marketplace",
    "asin"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "asin": {
      "type": "string",
      "examples": [
        {
          "value": "B07Z82895W",
          "summary": "示例 ASIN"
